.TH RAINDROPS 1
.SH NAME
raindrops \- rain on glass demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/raindrops
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I RainDrops
is a rain on glass demo.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Raindrops wet a glass grid. Holding 1 or 2 places hotspots.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B 1 (hold)
Hotspot 1
.TP
.B 2 (hold)
Hotspot 2
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/raindrops.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
